      "role": "system",
      "content": "Shared frozen semantic rules (both interfaces):\nOnly existing value/check/compose/atom/end nodes and const/ref/add/le/eq expressions. No executable code, callbacks, new meanings or external effects. Int64 is signed64, Bool distinct, Unit null. add/le require Int64; eq requires identical operand types. add overflow rejects OVERFLOW. check needs Bool, yields Unit; false rejects with its code at site's provenance. Failure absorbs all later operations. Each step executes once in submitted order; result evaluates after steps. Immutable bindings, exact types, no shadowing, forward references, cycles or free variables. Call arguments are only refs/literals, matching exact named signature; templates substitute expressions rather than eager call-by-value. Nested seq provenance/work preserved. UInt8 atom consumes one byte, end rejects trailing data. Host uses empty byte input and fixed UInt16BE output0..65535; no reads needed for these objectives. Bounds: max7 authored definitions+HostEntry;8 inputs/definition;32 steps/region;128 stored/package;depth8 expressions;max64 expanded VM nodes;nesting4;64KiB strict JSON. Target Int64 and exact requested input signature. No persistent mutable symbol registry. All authored definitions are validated. Names ASCII letter then letters/digits/underscore max32. HostEntry reserved. Cryptographic sealing is mechanical and shared by both tracks; no semantic repair. \n\nUse native tools only. Expressions use scalar literals, $input_or_prior_alias, or [add|le|eq,operand,operand]. dependencies lists all referenced input/local aliases exactly once. No solution is supplied. Finalize using define_result, then validate_candidate. Rejected calls leave state unchanged. Maximum3 definitions/4 inputs/8 steps; expression one binary layer. Target Int64. No chat packet or examples."
    },
